{"type":"message","id":"6c12aca2","parentId":"2b258201","timestamp":"2026-03-17T15:59:11.012Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Done — I updated `TOOLS.md` so the `llm_distillator` entry now matches the structure of the other tool descriptions, and I explicitly clarified that it should be suggested only after symptoms have been discussed and a tool has just produced a diagnostic output.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_091ae413d874a4dd0169b97a4dca1881918f919c9f320ebe61\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":229,"output":61,"cacheRead":15360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15650,"cost":{"input":0.0005725000000000001,"output":0.000915,"cacheRead":0.0038399999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0053275}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773763149025}}
